{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And they shall be for you a perpetual statute.</b> For the camps journey to wage battle — do you not see Moses' words when the ark set out? And behold, the interpretation of \"this statute\" is: thus shall you do — the priests shall sound the trumpets when they go to war, to wage battle against the land of their enemies, and likewise when an enemy comes into your land and you go to war against him."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:59.443571527Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}